\newlabel{fig:multiplier}{{6}{17}{TBR dependence on Lead fraction in the $\text {Li}_{(100-x)}\text {Pb}_x$ breeder. Breeding performance peaks at approximately 50\% lead concentration, with a rapid decline observed beyond 75\%. The eutectic point is marked for reference. Error bars are included but are too small to be visible at this scale}{figure.caption.8}{}}
