\newlabel{fig:blanket_thicknesses}{{10}{19}{Analysis of Breeder Blanket radial thickness. (a) TBR saturates at approximately 500 mm, suggesting full neutron attenuation. (b) Cross-sectional heatmap of reaction density. The reaction rate drops to negligible levels beyond the 600 mm mark, confirming the saturation thickness observed in (a). Error bars are included but are too small to be visible at this scale}{figure.caption.12}{}}
